BT /F1 7 Tf 10.5 TL 28 812 Td (scoring_methodology.pdf) ' () ' (Scoring methodology for the Q3 2025 close) ' () ' (Base scores. A CVSS 3.x base score is computed from the vector with the CVSS 3.1 specification formulas. ISS =) ' (1 - \(1 - C\)\(1 - I\)\(1 - A\).) ' (Impact is 6.42 x ISS when scope is unchanged and 7.52 x \(ISS - 0.029\) - 3.25 x \(ISS - 0.02\)^15 when scope is) ' (changed. Exploitability is) ' (8.22 x AV x AC x PR x UI. Weights: AV N 0.85, A 0.62, L 0.55, P 0.2; AC L 0.77, H 0.44; PR N 0.85, L 0.62, H) ' (0.27 when scope is unchanged) ' (and N 0.85, L 0.68, H 0.5 when scope is changed; UI N 0.85, R 0.62; C, I and A H 0.56, L 0.22, N 0. When) ' (impact is at most 0 the score is) ' (0. Otherwise the score is Roundup\(min\(impact + exploitability, 10\)\) for unchanged scope and Roundup\(min\(1.08 x) ' (\(impact + exploitability\), 10\)\)) ' (for changed scope. For CVSS:3.1 vectors Roundup is the CVSS 3.1 Appendix A function: let i = round\(x x) ' (100000\); when i is divisible by) ' (10000 the result is i / 100000, otherwise \(floor\(i / 10000\) + 1\) / 10. For CVSS:3.0 vectors Roundup is the) ' (smallest number with one) ' (decimal that is at least x. Severity bands: none 0.0; low 0.1 to 3.9; medium 4.0 to 6.9; high 7.0 to 8.9;) ' (critical 9.0 to 10.0.) ' () ' (Service weight. weight = tier weight x deploy factor, rounded half to even to 4 decimals. Tier weights: tier) ' (0: 4.0, tier 1: 2.5, tier 2: 1.5, tier 3: 1.0. The deploy factor is) ' (min\(2, 1 + deploys / 365\); it is 1 when deploys is null.) ' () ' (Remediation estimate. The estimate of an exposure is the estimate override of remediation_estimates.xlsx for) ' (the package and the pinned) ' (version's major version with the latest effective date on or before 2025-09-30, when there is one. Otherwise) ' (it is base hours of the) ' (severity x the complexity factor x the upgrade multiplier, rounded half to even to 2 decimals. Base hours:) ' (critical: 16, high: 8, medium: 4, low: 2, none: 1. The complexity factor is) ' (the factor row below for the package and the pinned major version with the latest effective date on or before) ' (2025-09-30, otherwise 1. The) ' (upgrade multiplier is 3 when there is no fixed version, 2 when the fixed version's major version is above the) ' (pinned major version, and 1) ' (otherwise.) ' () ' (Complexity factors) ' () ' (BATCH P001) ' (rid | rev | st | rec_at | eco | name | major | factor | effective) ' (cf-000988 | 1 | A | 2024-09-03T00:00:00Z | cargo | jetwyn-async | 2 | 1.125 | 2024-09-27) ' (cf-007360 | 1 | A | 2025-08-04T00:00:00Z | pypi | calsol-queue | 2 | 1.667 | 2025-08-31) ' (cf-001232 | 1 | A | 2025-03-01T00:00:00Z | cargo | lumgal-retry | 3 | 1.667 | 2025-03-10) ' (cf-002942 | 1 | A | 2025-07-10T00:00:00Z | maven | org.fyrlum:ulgra-auth | 2 | 0.75 | 2025-07-18) ' (cf-008663 | 1 | A | 2025-07-01T00:00:00Z | pypi | pelion-yaml | 3 | 2.5 | 2025-07-11) ' (cf-003433 | 1 | A | 2024-09-27T00:00:00Z | maven | org.kelkin:KinwynDNS | 0 | 2.5 | 2024-10-09) ' (cf-000383 | 1 | A | 2025-04-19T00:00:00Z | cargo | crypto-berpax | 2 | 0.75 | 2025-05-01) ' (cf-005759 | 1 | A | 2025-01-30T00:00:00Z | npm | elgra-metrics | 1 | 0.5 | 2025-02-04) ' (cf-006025 | 1 | A | 2025-08-07T00:00:00Z | npm | halor-mock | 1 | 1.125 | 2025-08-17) ' (cf-000716 | 1 | A | 2025-07-30T00:00:00Z | cargo | graquin-http | 2 | 1.333 | 2025-08-25) ' (cf-003435 | 1 | A | 2024-11-25T00:00:00Z | maven | org.kelkin.legacy:KinwynDNS | 1 | 1.333 | 2024-12-10) ' (cf-004359 | 1 | A | 2024-09-14T00:00:00Z | maven | org.torjet:uldor-orm | 1 | 1.125 | 2024-10-13) ' (cf-007721 | 1 | A | 2024-12-21T00:00:00Z | pypi | galel-zip | 1 | 1.667 | 2025-01-13) ' (cf-004058 | 1 | A | 2025-07-24T00:00:00Z | maven | org.paxyar:uldex-tls | 1 | 1.333 | 2025-08-17) ' (cf-003339 | 1 | A | 2025-07-01T00:00:00Z | maven | com.ionmar:orcal-cli | 2 | 2.5 | 2025-07-17) ' (cf-003830 | 1 | A | 2025-03-09T00:00:00Z | maven | org.nimhex:QuinmarRETRY | 2 | 0.5 | 2025-04-08) ' (cf-006922 | 1 |